{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Bound cleanup after durable suspension or retry.** Even after the manager selects `PENDING` or `RETRYING`, this waits indefinitely for the handler and its `finally` blocks before running end hooks. A blocked cleanup can consume the Lambda deadline and prevent the durable response from reaching the service. Reserve response time using `lambdaContext.getRemainingTimeInMillis()` and convert overdue cleanup into a retryable invocation failure; add low-deadline regression tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77py6J","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":128,"observation_digest":"b7a582224f24cc1505188fa1a4b2928c818822b02cef40ad5e2d0c70618ef605","observation_id":"aro_v1_w6syeispetgbkbiyr6q2jmusrs","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:17:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_byfv4myspbecnazbrjfoecyqnt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"75df3beef29048065ff50232c240e58b4e06e311","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_4eylqqiwhy67dbbmt7wpkzly3j","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:17:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
